  ],
  "texto": "You've been manipulated. By a partner. A friend. Even your own family. And it was never an accident. There are 5 tactics behind it. This is Part 1 of 3 — and by the end, you'll never miss it again. Therapists see these same patterns in almost every unhealthy relationship. Tactic one is bad. Tactic three is the one that gets people the worst — stay till you hear it. Number one: gaslighting. They make you doubt your own memory. Your own eyes. 'That never happened.' 'You're overreacting.' 'You're crazy.' It's not confusion. It's control. It's control. It's control. Number two: love bombing. Too much, too fast — gifts, texts, 'soulmate,' in week one. It's not passion. It's a hook. The faster it starts, the harder it can trap you. Tactic three is the one almost nobody notices — until it's already working on them. That's Part 2.",
  "voz": "en-US-GuyNeural"
}